# Require maintainer review for the files that DEFINE the security gate.
#
# Strix scans its own repo (.github/workflows/worm-guard.yml), but that gate runs the action code
# and allowlist FROM THE PULL REQUEST UNDER REVIEW — so it cannot, by itself, stop a PR that weakens
# it (e.g. neutering action.yml or widening config/security.yml's allowlist). Branch protection +
# code-owner review of these paths is the real control.
#
# ACTIVATION: this file only has teeth when the default branch's protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled. Turn that on in repo Settings → Branches.

/action.yml            @Ndevu12
/config/security.yml   @Ndevu12
/.github/              @Ndevu12
